        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Czarny, there're too many calls coming from the various departments, we can't handle them all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Just think of something. Try to make those still sane understand that 'victory' and 'value' are not equal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "O-okay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_105",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sir 'Left-hand', do you really not require further medical examination?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_105",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No. Being able to knock me unconscious right when I was casting my Arts is already the limit of her ability. She's still far from being able to seriously injure me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_105",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Pardon my bluntness, but the results of this match were a shock to many.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_105",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even without an insignificant victory in this match, I will still bring the entirety of the Blade Helmet Knightclub into the Major with me. Worry not, spokesman.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_105",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're very confident, good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you had gone all out, Maria Nearl would have stood no chance of victory. I hope that you will be able to deal with the fallout of this unexpected loss...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_105",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I will not make excuses for myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_105",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You may end up losing opportunities from some major sponsors. Perhaps your Knightclub can\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_105",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014If those people are only able to see the most superficial wins and losses and cannot understand how to manage their interests, then they are not fit to work with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_105",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hype is the basis of profit. The customers have only ever cared about what they can see. In other words, they are only trying to get some sensory stimulation... without being aware of it themselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, I never expected that Sir Tytus Topola himself would place such a clear price on his own 'failure'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_105",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Spokesman, do not attempt to provoke me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Left-hand Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_105",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, yes, my apologies......We will leave as soon as we are done handling all those troublesome matters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_105",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let us meet again at the Major, Sir 'Left-hand'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_courtyard",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So that's it... Sona and them were doing such things...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected fighters' arena. I'd heard of this competition format... No, this cannot even be considered a 'format'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether or not they come from a knight family, anyone can become a competition knight, earn the recognition of the Knights Association through their grit and become a noble...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the Infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They'll let the Infected join the competitions, but there's no country that would let an Infected become a pillar of society. That's why they're segregated in another competition format.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected can earn money and live on, but they'll forever be simple gladiators trying to entertain the masses... Tch. There ain't any meaning to such a sideshow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I don't mean anything by that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You old geezer, can't you be more tactful with your words?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Who in hell am I supposed to be tactful for, huh? They're almost onto us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected matter is worrying, but... now is not the time to be worrying about them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "They changed their fate as Infected through their own tenacity... But they've saved many people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we want to change anything, we will have to continue moving forward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Little Maria has become a respectable knight capable of such words... If only Margaret could see this, surely she would be gratified...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't speak of the Radiant Knight like she's dead, you idiot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the one twisting my words, Kowal!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Maria? What's wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "N-Nothing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
