    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The Champion's Wall... What a lousy place for conversation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Pictures of all the old champions, huh. This Black Knight alone has three spots.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though she dominated the Major for so many years, she doesn't seem to have aged a day... Eh, why do I feel like she looks younger than me...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss must be kidding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that just good genes? How nice. How enviable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Black Knight surely left an impressive mark on the history of knight sports. No one could have ever guessed that a Leithanian completely incapable of using Arts would ever become the 'Black Knight' we know today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her era is long gone, however... She herself has left Kazimierz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't expect you to let go of a cash cow like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "...A dominating champion would indeed invite many worshippers, but it is very much a detriment to the development of the industry as a whole, in the long run...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "In short, it's exciting to see new challengers attempting to defeat the Black Knight, but after she managed to hold her own for three entire seasons... It started to get boring.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Black Knight's prospects near the end of her career weren't very good. The number of people who wanted to get rid of her one way or another could fill an entire arena.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her luck was pretty good, though. Just as she was being cornered, she met a VIP from Kjerag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "She got a reasonable price... that satisfied everyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Being able to support a good turnover is also a sign of a well-developed industry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "...And then there's this, an empty space.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Radiant Knight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. I don't think I need to elaborate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know this one. From last season, the Blood Knight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Blood Knight's terror and might are unprecedented in the arena. Thankfully, he's rather astute and hasn't caused much trouble for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should tell him to take it easy on the drugs from time to time. Knights are the most important assets, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will take that to heart, Miss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "...Well? I don't suppose the spokesman of the General Chamber of Commerce invited me here for a history lesson?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry to trouble you. The Champion's Wall will be open to the public during the Major, so I have to do a check beforehand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, this is also one of the few places where I can speak without interruption.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... Alright. It's about another job, isn't it? I can't get away anyway, so I might as well listen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not just about a job... I wonder if you know what the two Lazurites are doing today?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not cleared to know. And neither am I.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've heard some interesting rumors on the grapevine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "What sort of major incident could've happened, that would need both Lazurites moving out in force?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014Ahh la la, I didn't hear anything. Nothing at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've checked all the requests from the other directors. There isn't a single 'major incident' that would require a Lazurite, let alone both of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have worry about that. Just know it's an order from the General Chamber of Commerce.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that so...? I can rest assured then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You really don't trust me, huh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you say so, Miss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know very well that asking me stuff about my bosses is a waste of time. Are you trying to give a warning to this 'immature Platinum'? Alright, alright, message received.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're very smart. However, my suspicions are also very valid. Even if the upper echelons are hiding things from me, I must perform my duties to perfection.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. If you can, please instruct a subordinate of yours to help keep track of someone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Czarny glances at the empty spot on the wall next to him."
    },
    {
        "text": "M\u0142ynar Nearl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though I think that he'll remain a useless piece of trash till the end, we must ensure that he does not affect our future plans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for you, Miss, you must personally ensure that this carries on smoothly\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
