        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Ouch\u2014\u2014! P-please be more gentle...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bear with it! This ointment is really expensive!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's my fault for not teaching you this. Being able to properly manage your injuries during a competition is also important. Lift up your hair.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, I didn't expect that it would\u2014\u2014Ah, ouch!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Going up against Ingra and then Topola, you should count your lucky stars that all four limbs are intact and you haven't suffered any major injuries...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, put your clothes on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't move for a few days and just stay still. Ending up with a stubborn old wound is one of the worst dangers of being a knight. Don't be like me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Auntie... err Zofia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maria, that combat style... How did you come up with it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Rather than a combat style... Err, I was forced into it, actually...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the time, my only thoughts were 'Just hold on. There must be something I can do'\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Ouch!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't put yourself through hell for such a stupid reason! The accumulated fatigue will just make your next battles harder!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*... Luckily you were able to take advantage of the carelessness of that 'Left-hand.' If that sadistic pervert didn't underestimate you... then you'd be in trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, have you fought him before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "His first match after officially joining the Blade Helmet Knightclub was against me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "O-Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why he refuses to talk to anyone about his debut battle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's all in the past, though... There is always a winner and loser in knight sports... He doesn't care about me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mr. Tytus seemed to recognize Margaret.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep. The three members of Blade Helmet Knightclub, including him, tried to encircle Margaret during the melee, but ended up getting annihilated instead. Who would accept such an outrageous thing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I-Is Margaret so merciless?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Margaret was very young back then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What was she thinking?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember that she hated knight sports more than anything, right? There was a time when I even thought that she was just like Uncle M\u0142ynar...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in the end, she still went and became a competition knight, and even became the Radiant Knight...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't know what she was thinking either. But she should be more aware than most what the knight sports represent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even so, she still went, and climbed to the peak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the very least, there were quite a few people who fervently admired Margaret and were inspired by her to become knights, including me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ehehe...To be honest, that was part of the reason for me too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who knows, maybe the reason she became the champion was to get a few more Zofias and Marias.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I wonder if she's living well, at that Rhodes Island place...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahh\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-What? Don't surprise me like that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-There's a notch on my blade...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... You haven't been able to properly maintain your weapons, so it's not surprising that it ended up like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you deal with it yourself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh* Maybe, if I could borrow Master Kowal's workshop...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
