    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's up, V? Focus on driving. Don't make me get out and call a taxi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just thinking about those two squirrels... If you get out now I swear I'll run you over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Those Infected, huh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That day we almost got into a fight. Those people outside... could they have been?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Most likely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Have they set their sights on Maria as well? Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...You're overthinking it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it gonna rain the day after tomorrow?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Cloudy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
